  pyableton Set for the parts that did not change). Only the elements the reader uses are here.
  Live 12 calls the master track MainTrack and routes to it as AudioOut/Main.
  Kick (audio) -> Main. Bass (MIDI, in group Low End) runs Serum (VST3), then a Compressor sidechained from Kick.
  Low End (group) has an Audio Effect Rack with Saturator and Pro-Q 3 (VST3). One return, A-Reverb.
-->
